{
  "id": "ebb:demo/windowsill_ash_dialogue",
  "start": "start",
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "窗台上有一圈灰，像有人把夜晚掐灭在这里。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "inspect",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "分辨灰烬和泥点。",
          "next": "inspect_line",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "reveal_clue",
              "id": "ebb:demo/tenant_false_window"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "collect",
          "type": "action",
          "text": "把一点灰抹到纸角上。",
          "next": "collect_line",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_story_var",
              "layer": "minor",
              "id": "ash_sample",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "thought",
          "type": "thought",
          "text": "窗户不是出口，是借口的展示柜。",
          "next": "thought_line"
        }
      ]
    },
    "inspect_line": {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "灰烬很细，不像壁炉，更像有人在等一个信号时烧完了耐心。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "回到观察。",
          "next": "start"
        }
      ]
    },
    "collect_line": {
      "speaker": "inner voice",
      "text": "你获得的不是物品，而是一种之后让谎话变慢的凭据。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "回到观察。",
          "next": "start"
        }
      ]
    },
    "thought_line": {
      "speaker": "inner voice",
      "text": "所有窗户都通向外面；只有这扇通向住客的句子。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "回到观察。",
          "next": "start"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
